(Product Operation Manual) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(1. Overview) Tj T*
(This manual describes how to operate the knowledge base platform.) Tj T*
(The platform supports document import, permission control and AI Q&A.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2. Importing Documents) Tj T*
(Supported formats are PDF, Markdown, Word and plain text.) Tj T*
(After upload the system parses the content, splits it into chunks) Tj T*
(and stores the vectors in the vector database.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3. Data Permission) Tj T*
(Every knowledge unit has no permission by default.) Tj T*
(Configure global, department, role or user entities.) Tj T*
(Access is granted when any of the configured entities matches.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4. AI Question Answering) Tj T*
(The system recalls candidate units, checks data permission,) Tj T*
(and only authorized units are used to compose the answer.) Tj T*
(If a recalled unit is not authorized, the answer includes a notice.) Tj T*
ET
